<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--todo:
add dynamic graphics and the proper wood types
add a way for the tree to recognize techs; the tree can then grow the bark.
Alternatively, add a meditation method or some sort of gizmo operation that unlocks with other techs. This is how the player "guides" the tree.
